            {
                "content": "# Monthly discharge of Middle Eel River near Covelo, Cal., for the years ending Sept. 30, 1911-1913. (cont.)\n\n## SOUTH FORK OF EEL RIVER AT GARBERVILLE, CAL.\n\n- LOCATION.-In the SW. 1/4 sec. 24, T. 4 S., R. 3 E. , at highway bridge, about a mile southwest of Garberville.\n\n- RECORDS AVAILABLE.-August 25, 1911, to September 5, 1913, when station was dis- continued.\n\nDRAINAGE AREA.-84 square miles.\n\nGAGE.-Chain gage on downstream side of bridge; length of chain changed to 51.02 feet beginning May 18, 1913.\n\n- CHANNEL.-Bowlders and gravel; somewhat shifting during high water.\n\n- DISCHARGE MEASUREMENTS.-Made - from bridge or by wading.\n\n- ACCURACY.-Rating curves fairly well defined for low and medium stages. Esti- mates for high water approximate.",
                "embed": "# Monthly discharge of Middle Eel River near Covelo, Cal., for the years ending Sept. 30, 1911-1913. (cont.)\n\n## SOUTH FORK OF EEL RIVER AT GARBERVILLE, CAL.\n\n- LOCATION.-In the SW. 1/4 sec. 24, T. 4 S., R. 3 E. , at highway bridge, about a mile southwest of Garberville.\n\n- RECORDS AVAILABLE.-August 25, 1911, to September 5, 1913, when station was dis- continued.\n\nDRAINAGE AREA.-84 square miles.\n\nGAGE.-Chain gage on downstream side of bridge; length of chain changed to 51.02 feet beginning May 18, 1913.\n\n- CHANNEL.-Bowlders and gravel; somewhat shifting during high water.\n\n- DISCHARGE MEASUREMENTS.-Made - from bridge or by wading.\n\n- ACCURACY.-Rating curves fairly well defined for low and medium stages. Esti- mates for high water approximate.",
